  idQuest: 33
  tenNhiemVu: "D\u1EA1 H\u1ED1ng Lang B\u1EA7y"
  loaiQuest: 0
  idQuaiCanDiet: 3
  soLuongBoXuongCanDiet: 225
  idDoiTuongCanGiaiCuu: 0
  soLuongCanGiaiCuu: 1
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "\u0110\xEAm xu\u1ED1ng, ti\u1EBFng h\xFA d\u1ECB ng\u1EE3m
    c\u1EE7a \u0111\xE0n ma lang vang v\u1ECDng kh\u1EAFp U Minh L\xE2m l\xE0m ai
    c\u0169ng khi\u1EBFp \u0111\u1EA3m. \u0110\xE0n s\xF3i bi\u1EBFn d\u1EA1ng v\xEC
    ma kh\xED n\xE0y c\u1EF1c k\u1EF3 hung h\xE3n, ch\xFAng \u0111i theo \u0111\xE0n
    v\xE0 x\xE9 x\xE1c m\u1ECDi s\u1ED1ng linh. Xin h\xE3y di\u1EC7t s\u1EA1ch ch\xFAng"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "Ti\u1EBFng h\u1ED1ng g\u1EA7m m\xE1u me v\u1EABn v\u0103ng v\u1EB3ng
    quanh c\xE1c t\xE1n c\xE2y \u0111\u1ED9c... \u0110\u1EA1o h\u1EEFu h\xE3y c\u1EA9n
    th\u1EADn \u0111\xF2n ph\u1ED1i h\u1EE3p c\u1EE7a b\u1EA7y s\xF3i ma v\xE0 h\u1EA1
    g\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EE7 s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng y\xEAu th\xFA!"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "\u0110\xEAm nay U Minh L\xE2m cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng c\u0169ng c\xF3
    m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt t\u0129nh l\u1EB7ng. Nh\u1EDD s\u1EF1 gan d\u1EA1 c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1EA1o
    h\u1EEFu m\xE0 n\u1ED7i kinh ho\xE0ng mang t\xEAn ma lang \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB
    \u0111\xE8 b\u1EB9p"
